# Wander comes with a scene, Pitch lock on too (Evan, 2026-11-08 / 11-10): P3 Seance has Wander, P1 Niagara none;
# par71 Scene time (0: 0.1 s), par74 Pitch lock, par78 Wander; 'wander' is drone II's move by it (cents)
notips
set 71 0
set 74 1
press SEL
tapkey w14
release SEL
tap PLAY
tapkey w2
wait 3000
expect par74 1
expect par78 >0
tapkey w0
wait 3000
expect par78 0
expect par74 1
wait 2000
expect wander 0
